// Modifications: only the bool-comparison half of `test_bool` ported.
// Logos rejects bitwise &/|/^ on bool ("operator '^': right must be
// integer, got bool") — Logos divergence from Rust (Rust implements
// BitAnd/BitOr/BitXor for bool); filed for future review.
